## Trademark Status Note

**Formal trademark searches (USPTO TESS, IPOS, EUIPO) have NOT been performed.** The risk ratings are based on:
- Web presence of similarly-named companies
- Industry overlap analysis
- Trademark strength assessment (fanciful/arbitrary = strongest)

**Recommended next step:** Run formal USPTO TESS searches for the Top 15 in Nice Classes 9 (software) and 42 (SaaS). Cost: $0 (self-service at tmsearch.uspto.gov) or $500–1,500 with a trademark attorney.

